197| *   wins byte-for-byte (an empty value counts as omitted); otherwise the
198| *   task-folder default for the resolved task id. Throws naming the
199| *   expected --out form when no id is discoverable — never a repo-root
200| *   fallback. Pure: env, branch, and clock are injected so tests never
201| *   launch git or Playwright.
